Audio permission filter (src/audio/aperms.ts)

src/audio/aperms.ts adapts the aperms filter of FFmpeg libavfilter/f_perms.c
(CONFIG_APERMS_FILTER): its option table (mode none/ro/rw/toggle/random, seed in
[-1, UINT32_MAX], positional order mode then seed) and its filter_frame, which
only changes frame writability (ff_inlink_make_frame_writable or av_frame_clone)
and forwards the samples, count and timestamps unchanged.

Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
